            "image": "shopify://shop_images/lucid-morgan-bw1.jpg",
            "title": "",
            "title_underline_style": "none",
            "text": "<p>Morgan’s passion for hoop dance has sent her around the world as an instructor and performer. Known for her Hoopography, she has been featured in many music videos and was cast to play a hooping character created specifically for her in Showtime’s Roadies.</p><p>With a background in film making, Morgan fuses her love for cinematic storytelling and hoopdance by creating award-winning hoop videos. She hopes to collaborate with more artists, dancers, and creators, and to continue directing videos that will push hoopdance into the mainstream to spread joy of hooping.</p><p>Morgan can be found spinning with her hoop troupe, Hooptown Hotties and performing solo as Miss Mo’Jangles.</p>",
