            "title": "",
            "title_underline_style": "none",
            "text": "<p>Lee is a southeastern based performance artist who fuses various dance styles with prop manipulation to create a beautiful display of grace and skill.</p><p>With a background in hip hop and tutting, his unique hoop style has distinguished him as one of the most highly sought after teachers and performers for festivals and workshops.</p><p>He not only performs with hoops, but is proficient with fire fans, poi, fire hoops and staff. Lee’s goal is to see the art and freedom of hooping expand as both an integral part of the dance industry, and a platform for self expression.</p>",
