        },
        "content_qPKwRT": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "page": "",
            "text": "<p>Lee and Morgan’s paths crossed as instructors at Hoopcamp in 2015. Their first collaboration was the groundbreaking and award winning video, Flowmance, which features steamy partner Hoopography and a story of passion and jealousy.</p><p>Despondence was their second film as creators and performers using the hoop as a lens to explore deep emotion and a forward moving story exposing the dark shadows of depression that cast over one’s mind and relationships.</p><p>LUCID is their latest hoopography production and is truly a cinematic experience building on the enchanting universe of their unique flowmance.</p>",
            "font": "secondary",
            "font_weight": "400"
          }
        }
      },
